msgctxt "quest/012/BanAma005_01221:TEXT_BANAMA005_01221_SWIFT_000_103:1"
msgid "And though we are never in short supply of beastman-related problems, I believe you've earned a respite from the chaos. Enjoy the rest while you may, <if ($gn52 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split></if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 敵の気配を感じた！！
#. de: Du spürst eine feindliche Präsenz!
#. fr: Vous ressentez une présence hostile<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/012/BanAma005_01221:TEXT_BANAMA005_01221_POP_MESSAGE:1"
msgid "You sense a hostile presence!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「アマルジャ族：灰の一党」との友好関係が<br>「信頼」になりました。<br>冒険者の活躍は、アマルジャ族の間でも広く語られるでしょう！
#. de: Das Verhältnis zu den Amalj'aa von der Bruderschaft der Asche hat sich zu „Vertraut“ verbessert. Die Echsenkrieger achten dich und erzählen sich respektvoll Geschichten über deine Heldentaten.
#. fr: Votre réputation auprès des Amalj'aa de la Ligue des cendres est passée à “Estimé”. Grâce à vos actions, vos relations avec les membres de ce peuple s'améliorent de jour en jour.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/012/BanAma005_01221:TEXT_BANAMA005_01221_SYSTEM_200_000:1"
msgid "You have achieved <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Trusted</ui-edge-color></ui-color> reputation with the Brotherhood of Ash."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、「アマルジャ族のよろず屋」より、<br>「友好関係：信頼」の商品の購入ができるようになりました。<br>今後の冒険に役立てましょう！
#. de: Außerdem kannst du von dem Amalj'aa-Händler im Ring der Asche die Waren erwerben, die vertrauten Verbündeten der Amalj'aa vorbehalten sind.
#. fr: Le vendeur amalj'aa vous propose maintenant les objets correspondant au rang “Estimé”.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/012/BanAma005_01221:TEXT_BANAMA005_01221_SYSTEM_200_001:1"
msgid "Furthermore, you now have access to a wider selection of wares from the Brotherhood of Ash vendor."
msgstr ""
